<title>TURKEY: TURKEY JUNE '96 TRADE DEFICIT UP 25.3 PCT YR-ON-YR.</title>
<headline>TURKEY JUNE '96 TRADE DEFICIT UP 25.3 PCT YR-ON-YR.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's foreign trade deficit rose 25.3 percent in June to $1.52 billion from $1.21 billion in June 1995, the State Institute of Statistics said.</p>
<p>TRADE (BLN DLRS)  June96  June95  Jan-June96  Jan-June95</p>
<p> Exports		1.804   1.835   10.881	 9.955</p>
<p> Imports		3.323   3.047   20.069	15.469</p>
<p> Trade Balance	1.519   1.212    9.188	 5.514</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures on customs-cleared basis and may not add up due to rounding.</p>
<p>-- Ankara newsroom +90-312-446 2940</p>
</text>
